{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:55:16+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:55:16+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Nanobiotix S.A.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"France","city":"Paris","website":"https://www.nanobiotix.com","employees":98,"summary":"Nanobiotix S.A. operates as a clinical-stage biotechnology that focuses on developing product candidates for the treatment of cancer and other unmet medical needs. Its lead product candidate is NBTXR3, a sterile aqueous suspension of crystalline hafnium oxide nanoparticles used for the treatment of soft tissue sarcoma, head and neck, liver, prostate, pancreatic, esophageal, rectal, and non-small cell lung cancer. The company has a partnership with Lian Oncology Limited to develop and commercialize NBTXR3 in China, South Korea, Singapore, and Thailand. Nanobiotix S.A. was incorporated in 2003 and is based in Paris, France.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Nanobiotix S.A. fonctionne comme une biotechnologie de stade clinique qui se concentre sur le développement de produits candidats pour le traitement du cancer et d'autres besoins médicaux non satisfaits. Son principal produit candidat est NBTXR3, une suspension aqueuse stérile de nanoparticules d'oxyde d'hafnium cristallin utilisées pour le traitement du sarcome des tissus mous, de la tête et du cou, du foie, de la prostate, du pancréas, de l'œsophage, du rectum et du cancer du poumon non à petites cellules. La société a conclu un partenariat avec Lian Oncology Limited pour développer et commercialiser NBTXR3 en Chine, en Corée du Sud, à Singapour et en Thaïlande."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1434625024,"shares_outstanding":50945492,"trailing_pe":null,"forward_pe":-112.64,"price_to_book":null,"ev_to_ebitda":-51.571,"ev_to_revenue":133.503,"dividend_yield":0.0,"payout_ratio":null,"b